// Toolkit docs, github.com/nuxt-modules/mcp-toolkit `apps/docs/` at
// 2a31848dcc6d3cf4c251055ce28b8f866fdb5c61 (MIT; Docus 5.13.0 on Nuxt 4.5.2,
// Nuxt Content 3.16.0, and Nuxt UI 4.11.3, in a pnpm 12 and Turborepo
